65905" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="205">Awesome — a 6-page static website about <strong data-start="40" data-end="60">Anakin Skywalker</strong> will be a fun and visually impressive project. Below is a <strong data-start="119" data-end="145">complete working setup</strong> (HTML + CSS) that meets all your assignment requirements.</p>
<p data-start="207" data-end="220">I’ll include:</p>
<ul data-start="222" data-end="566">
<li data-start="222" data-end="349">
<p data-start="224" data-end="349">✅ 6 pages (<code data-start="235" data-end="247">index.html</code>, <code data-start="249" data-end="266">early-life.html</code>, <code data-start="268" data-end="286">jedi-knight.html</code>, <code data-start="288" data-end="311">fall-to-darkness.html</code>, <code data-start="313" data-end="331">darth-vader.html</code>, <code data-start="333" data-end="346">legacy.html</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="350" data-end="389">
<p data-start="352" data-end="389">✅ <code data-start="354" data-end="365">style.css</code> (external stylesheet)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="390" data-end="424">
<p data-start="392" data-end="424">✅ a sample YouTube video embed</p>
</li>
<li data-start="425" data-end="447">
<p data-start="427" data-end="447">✅ a table and list</p>
</li>
<li data-start="448" data-end="491">
<p data-start="450" data-end="491">✅ header, sidebar, and fixed navigation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="492" data-end="515">
<p data-start="494" data-end="515">✅ favicon and title</p>
</li>
<li data-start="516" data-end="566">
<p data-start="518" data-end="566">✅ a <code data-start="522" data-end="531">url.txt</code> placeholder for your hosted link</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="568" data-end="571">
