    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;Anakin’s fear of losing Padmé and distrust of the Jedi Council made him vulnerable to Palpatine’s manipulation. Seduced by the Dark Side, he became Darth Vader.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;

