  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">main</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;As Darth Vader, he became the right hand of Emperor Palpatine, enforcing the Empire’s will across the galaxy. Yet, deep inside, remnants of Anakin still lingered.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">img</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">src</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/76/Darth_Vader.jpg"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">alt</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Darth Vader"</span></span><span> /&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">main</span></span></span><span>&gt;
