    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;Anakin’s story ended in redemption when he sacrificed himself to save his son, Luke Skywalker, and destroy the Emperor. His legacy lives on as the Chosen One who ultimately brought balance to the Force.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
