<ul data-start="78" data-end="343">
<li data-start="78" data-end="118">
<p data-start="80" data-end="118">🌌 <strong data-start="83" data-end="100">Blue headings</strong> instead of gold</p>
</li>
<li data-start="119" data-end="228">
<p data-start="121" data-end="148">🌍 <strong data-start="124" data-end="146">New sidebar icons:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="151" data-end="228">
<li data-start="151" data-end="171">
<p data-start="153" data-end="171">🌍 Planet = Home</p>
</li>
<li data-start="174" data-end="199">
<p data-start="176" data-end="199">⛓️ Chain = Early Life</p>
</li>
<li data-start="202" data-end="228">
<p data-start="204" data-end="228">⚔️ Sword = Jedi Knight</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="229" data-end="343">
<p data-start="231" data-end="343">All other requirements (fixed header, fixed sidebar, CSS styling, favicon, video, table, etc.) still included.</p>
</li>
</ul>
