    </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;Born on Tatooine, Anakin Skywalker was a slave with exceptional piloting and mechanical skills. Jedi Master Qui-Gon Jinn discovered his strong connection to the Force, believing him to be the Chosen One destined to bring balance.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
