</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="925" data-end="983">Now you have an <strong data-start="941" data-end="951">images</strong> folder to hold all your photos.</p>
<hr data-start="985" data-end="988">
<h2 data-start="990" data-end="1027">🖼️ 3. Update the HTML image paths</h2>
<p data-start="1029" data-end="1082">In each HTML file, update your <code data-start="1060" data-end="1067">&lt;img&gt;</code> tag like this:</p>
