<p data-start="1878" data-end="2058">⚠️ However, <strong data-start="1890" data-end="1933">some sites block direct image embedding</strong> (called <em data-start="1942" data-end="1962">hotlink protection</em>).<br data-start="1964" data-end="1967">
If an image still doesn’t appear, download it and put it in your <code data-start="2032" data-end="2042">/images/</code> folder instead.</p>
<hr data-start="2060" data-end="2063">
<h2 data-start="2065" data-end="2089">💡 5. Quick checklist</h2>
<ul class="contains-task-list" data-start="2091" data-end="2329">
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2091" data-end="2163">
<p data-start="2097" data-end="2163"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" checked=""> The <code data-start="2101" data-end="2112">&lt;img src&gt;</code> path is correct (e.g., <code data-start="2136" data-end="2160">images/anakin-home.jpg</code>)</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2164" data-end="2209">
<p data-start="2170" data-end="2209"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" checked=""> The image is <strong data-start="2183" data-end="2207">in that exact folder</strong></p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2210" data-end="2256">
<p data-start="2216" data-end="2256"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" checked=""> The filename matches (case-sensitive!)</p>
</li>
<li class="task-list-item" data-start="2257" data-end="2329">
<p data-start="2263" data-end="2329"><input disabled="" type="checkbox" checked=""> The image file type (<code data-start="2284" data-end="2290">.jpg</code>, <code data-start="2292" data-end="2298">.png</code>, <code data-start="2300" data-end="2307">.webp</code>) matches the HTML tag</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2331" data-end="2334">
<h2 data-start="2336" data-end="2366">🔧 6. Test before uploading</h2>
<ol data-start="2368" data-end="2589">
<li data-start="2368" data-end="2437">
<p data-start="2371" data-end="2437">Open your <code data-start="2381" data-end="2393">index.html</code> directly in your browser (double-click it).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2438" data-end="2517">
<p data-start="2441" data-end="2517">If the image shows up <strong data-start="2463" data-end="2474">locally</strong>, it will also show up on <strong data-start="2500" data-end="2516">GitHub Pages</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2518" data-end="2589">
<p data-start="2521" data-end="2589">If it doesn’t show locally, the path or filename is still incorrect.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2591" data-end="2594">
<p data-start="2596" data-end="2617">If you’d like, I can:</p>
<ul data-start="2618" data-end="2745">
<li data-start="2618" data-end="2745">
<p data-start="2620" data-end="2745">🧰 Generate a <strong data-start="2634" data-end="2646">ZIP file</strong> containing all 6 pages with working local image paths and sample image files (all royalty-free).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2747" data-end="2784" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to do that for you?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.63