  </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">background</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">linear-gradient</span></span><span>(to right, </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#00aaff</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#ff0000</span></span><span>);
  -webkit-</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">background-clip</span></span><span>: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-</span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">color</span></span><span>: transparent;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">text-align</span></span><span>: center;
}
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="697" data-end="700">
<h3 data-start="702" data-end="720">💡 Explanation</h3>
<ul data-start="721" data-end="1067">
<li data-start="721" data-end="845">
<p data-start="723" data-end="845"><code data-start="723" data-end="768">linear-gradient(to right, #00aaff, #ff0000)</code><br data-start="768" data-end="771">
→ Creates a gradient that moves horizontally from <strong data-start="823" data-end="831">blue</strong> to <strong data-start="835" data-end="842">red</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="846" data-end="947">
<p data-start="848" data-end="947"><code data-start="848" data-end="880">-webkit-background-clip: text;</code><br data-start="880" data-end="883">
→ Clips the background gradient to the shape of the letters.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="948" data-end="1067">
<p data-start="950" data-end="1067"><code data-start="950" data-end="989">-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;</code><br data-start="989" data-end="992">
→ Makes the inside of the text transparent so you can see the gradient.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1069" data-end="1072">
<h3 data-start="1074" data-end="1086">✅ Result</h3>
<p data-start="1087" data-end="1273">All <code data-start="1091" data-end="1097">&lt;h1&gt;</code> and <code data-start="1102" data-end="1108">&lt;h2&gt;</code> headings across your website will now display with a <strong data-start="1162" data-end="1194">smooth fade from blue to red</strong> while keeping the rest of your style intact (same alignment, same font, etc.).</p>
<hr data-start="1275" data-end="1278">
<p data-start="1280" data-end="1433" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to make the <strong data-start="1310" data-end="1331">gradient animated</strong> (so it slowly shifts from blue → red → blue again)? It looks really cool for a Star Wars–style theme.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10