<hr data-start="1897" data-end="1900">
<h2 data-start="1902" data-end="1914">✅ Summary</h2>
<p data-start="1916" data-end="1933">To fix the error:</p>
<ul data-start="1934" data-end="2036">
<li data-start="1934" data-end="1975">
<p data-start="1936" data-end="1975">Use <code data-start="1940" data-end="1975">https://www.youtube.com/embed/...</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1976" data-end="1998">
<p data-start="1978" data-end="1998">Don’t use <code data-start="1988" data-end="1998">watch?v=</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1999" data-end="2036">
<p data-start="2001" data-end="2036">Or use your own <code data-start="2017" data-end="2023">.mp4</code> file locally</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2038" data-end="2041">
