<h2 data-start="818" data-end="839">🧠 3. Why it works</h2>
<p data-start="841" data-end="1004">YouTube Shorts don’t embed using the <code data-start="878" data-end="888">/shorts/</code> format — they require the same <code data-start="920" data-end="937">/embed/VIDEO_ID</code> structure as normal videos.<br data-start="965" data-end="968">
Here, the video ID is <code data-start="990" data-end="1003">FKEHflaxBEA</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="1006" data-end="1009">
<h2 data-start="1011" data-end="1065">🧪 4. Optional: make it responsive (fit any screen)</h2>
<p data-start="1067" data-end="1159">If you’d like your video to scale automatically on phones, add this CSS to your <code data-start="1147" data-end="1158">style.css</code>:</p>
