<h3 data-start="938" data-end="990">✅ Step 3: Style the video with your existing CSS</h3>
<p data-start="992" data-end="1091">If you’ve already added the CSS for your other video, it will automatically apply to this one, too.</p>
<p data-start="1093" data-end="1144">If not, make sure this is in your <code data-start="1127" data-end="1138">style.css</code> file:</p>
