<p data-start="54" data-end="235">YouTube Shorts are <strong data-start="73" data-end="92">vertical (9:16)</strong>, but most YouTube videos (like your Darth Vader one) are <strong data-start="150" data-end="171">horizontal (16:9)</strong> — so we’ll give each its own proper aspect ratio in your CSS.</p>
