<hr data-start="1526" data-end="1529">
<p data-start="1531" data-end="1544">✅ <strong data-start="1533" data-end="1544">Result:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1545" data-end="1746">
<li data-start="1545" data-end="1614">
<p data-start="1547" data-end="1614">The <strong data-start="1551" data-end="1570">gray header bar</strong> now spans the <em data-start="1585" data-end="1599">entire width</em> of the page.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1615" data-end="1704">
<p data-start="1617" data-end="1704">The <strong data-start="1621" data-end="1635">page title</strong> (<code data-start="1637" data-end="1643">&lt;h1&gt;</code>) is <em data-start="1648" data-end="1668">perfectly centered</em> both horizontally and vertically.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1705" data-end="1746">
<p data-start="1707" data-end="1746">The content below is spaced properly.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1748" data-end="1751">
